cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below, and state its test-set-exposure and data-rights caveats (see README)."
title: "Telangana Crop Intelligence: Historical Yield Baselines"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - alias: "Yafai01"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yafai01/telangana-crop-intelligence"
abstract: >-
  Transparent, reproducible historical baselines (B0-B4) for district-level crop
  yield in Telangana, evaluated with fixed-origin and rolling-origin time-based
  protocols on 12 crop-season combinations. A benchmark, not a production forecast.
keywords:
  - crop yield
  - Telangana
  - forecasting baselines
  - time-series evaluation
  - reproducibility
